(text "1  USB-C and controlled power-up" (at 15 37 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left)) (uuid c117c3c9-7816-5424-990b-1455905dc6e5))
(text "2  Arduino-compatible processor" (at 308 37 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left)) (uuid 68ac08ab-fd9f-5ac4-8e90-bb5ad8828415))
(text "3  USB programming and automatic reset" (at 15 205 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left)) (uuid 87ce28eb-8891-5423-9073-718eb837089d))
(text "4  PWM filter and quiet-volume attenuation" (at 308 205 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left)) (uuid 175215eb-51cc-52a8-941f-455750068a12))
(text "5  Recovery programming and test points" (at 15 315 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left)) (uuid 26c01313-6b90-570c-b36e-9300328bfc14))
(text "6  Analogue amplifier and speaker connector" (at 308 315 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left)) (uuid b3eb8c77-2482-553c-9142-7ca3934ded66))
(text "Separate 5.1k CC pull-downs. USB-C data and power; no PD negotiation." (at 25 178 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 4e2b6ecf-006f-5607-887e-31b3e598c3f8))
(text "U4 limits turn-on slew before downstream bulk capacitors. Verify inrush on hardware." (at 25 184 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid a92292f9-a3c4-58ca-a7bb-13d9b06a0b4a))
(text "16 MHz resonator includes load capacitors. AREF is decoupled, not tied to +5V." (at 320 180 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 0a10e71f-b50a-5631-958a-d8192ec31f86))
(text "A0 remains externally floating, as on the prototype, for the existing randomSeed call." (at 320 186 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 71d2c16f-4cd4-5aeb-87d4-e2cc1f2bc8d4))
(text "DTR falling edge resets U1 through C10. D1 clamps the positive reset pulse." (at 25 291 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid aebb0e31-762e-5e66-9fe5-695c6014b245))
(text "R8/R9 set a conservative starting volume. Tune by listening; do not assume a 3 W output." (at 320 289 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid f1a420fb-b4f2-5208-b432-5561d032ada2))
(text "Program bootloader and fuses through J2 before USB serial uploads can work." (at 25 380 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 06ff8ec6-3c5b-5ab4-88d4-aa2afd047b57))
(text "Use Arduino Uno / ATmega328P / 16 MHz / Optiboot, 115200 baud." (at 25 386 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 94d9ea57-a17c-5766-9759-a1e36d0ee54f))
(text "Do not connect a powered ISP source and USB power together." (at 25 392 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 6be65303-f6aa-55f6-9edf-f1954be4657e))
(text "Bridge output: neither speaker pin connects to GND. Keep speaker pair short / twisted." (at 320 407 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 677f2d12-55b5-5001-b79c-09f4f9319d01))
